sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Agent
  participant D as diffr
  participant R as Renderer
  A->>D: diagram source
  D->>R: validate(src)
  alt syntax error
    R-->>D: line 3, column 5: ...
    D-->>A: error, fix and resend
  else ok
    R-->>D: SVG
    D-->>A: ok: flowchart, 5 nodes
  end
  Note over D,R: rendered with the app theme
